            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Average activity per active station is calculated as full-period total activity (rentals + returns) divided by the number of active stations in each area. Active stations are stations observed during the analysis period. The metric is not adjusted for station capacity, historical operating days, or station changes and should not be interpreted as efficiency or utilization. Areas follow the source-defined categories, including 臺大公館校區.'"
